> [0c981e7](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36895/changes/0c981e75a9e7e352d1c0f08118596ea91a9fa102) _script: store witness stacks as their serialization_:

Splitting out [the interface and caller changes](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36521#pullrequestreview-5871920324) makes the review much easier to follow. A few more pieces could move earlier to avoid changing them twice.

- In the interface commit, switch `RecursiveDynamicUsage(const CTxIn&)` to the `CScriptWitness::DynamicMemoryUsage()` helper already added there.
- In the interface commit, define `front()` as `*begin()` and `back()` as `(*this)[size() - 1]`. The same iterators already work for `ToVectors()`, [the new `ToString()`](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36895#discussion_r4633256652) and, if we keep it, `ToSpans()`.
- Test how `ToString()` formats empty elements in the commit that adds the witness tests.

