> [2366d35](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36895/changes/2366d35e07710eb236a1f2ce3937cf2e40ac8de5) _span: add SameSpan_:

nit: For a follow-up, [AJ’s `SameSpan` helper](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36521#discussion_r4528821567) would let `NetGroupManager` check that it kept the full ASMap after the move. The current assertion checks only its starting address.
Maybe we could add this as a separate preceding PR to simplify this one...

